      "message": "We have a dynamic range for STREAM_VOICE_CALL. When SCO is connected the range is 0..15, otherwise the range is 1..15 with a step size \u003e 1 to emulate the tuned volume indices for voice call attenuation (usually it will result in 5 or 7 indices). That being said it is expected to have a different range when SCO is connected/disconnected and the HfP volume index can be slightly different than the index of STREAM_VOICE_CALL when no SCO device is connected",
